cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Chimera
message: >-
  If you use this software or its verification artifacts in your research,
  please cite it as below.
type: software
abstract: >-
  An open platform for trustworthy agentic scientific research: an agent
  proposes, deterministic non-model anchors verify each claim, and every run
  emits a certificate a third party can check offline, without trusting the
  platform that produced it.
authors:
  - name: The Chimera contributors
repository-code: 'https://github.com/Blite-HQ/chimera'
license: MIT
keywords:
  - verifiable-computing
  - agentic-systems
  - provenance
  - in-toto
  - quantum-computing
  - combinatorial-optimization
  - event-sourcing
